+ `Start-Process cmd ... -Verb RunAs`\n- Uses PowerShell `Get-NetTCPConnection` + `Stop-Process` with per-PID try/catch error reporting\n- Auto-closes after 3 seconds\n\n### C. `desktop_app/templates/index.html` — Major Redesign\n1. **Settings page (`screen-settings`):** Removed the redundant `System Logs Viewer` card (was a full terminal textarea). Replaced with `<textarea id=\"system-logs\" style=\"display: none;\">` for backward JS compatibility.\n2. **CSS (lines ~1008-1240+):** Completely replaced the old server CSS with new Zero-Scroll Dashboard CSS:\n   - `#screen-servers` uses `height: calc(100vh - 110px); overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;`\n   - New classes: `.servers-dashboard-header`, `.switcher-pills`, `.switcher-pill`, `.servers-grid-compact`, `.server-card-compact`, `.server-avatar`, `.meta-tag`, `.server-terminal-container` (flex:1), `.server-terminal-toolbar`, `.btn-outline-warning`, `.btn-terminal-action`, `.server-terminal-body`, `#ai-server-terminal` (flex:1, no fixed height)\n3. **HTML (screen-servers, lines ~1787-1940):** Replaced with:\n   - Sleek header bar with title + 1-Click Provider Switcher Pills (`pill-provider-gaistudio`, `pill-provider-chatgpt`)\n   - Hidden `active-banner-title`/`active-banner-sub` divs for backward JS compat\n   - Compact grid cards (~135px) with `.server-card-compact`, `.server-avatar`, `.meta-tag.port`, `.meta-tag.model`, `.server-url-caption`\n   - Action buttons in `.card-compact-actions` row (toggle, test, session, active)\n   - Full-height `server-terminal-container` with toolbar buttons: `freeServerPorts()` (⚡ تحرير المنافذ), refresh, clear\n4. **JavaScript `loadServersUI()` (lines ~3203-3310):** Updated to:\n   - Toggle `.active` class on switcher pills\n   - Read `srv.is_external` and `srv.is_managed` from backend\n   - Show `status-warning` badge (⚠️ محجوز خارجياً) for external processes\n   - Show `btn-outline-warning` (تحرير المنفذ) for external-occupied ports instead of misleading \"إيقاف السيرفر\"\n\n### D. `desktop_app/backend.py` — Already has\n- `free_server_ports()` (line 209) — calls `force_free_ports()` and logs\n- `add_server_log()`, `get_server_logs()`, `clear_server_logs()` — server logging API\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### Architecture\n- **`ServerInstance.get_status()`** returns `{\"running\": bool, \"is_managed\": bool, \"is_external\": bool, \"pid\": int|None, \"port\": int, ...}`. `running = is_listening OR is_managed`. `is_external = is_listening AND NOT is_managed`.\n- **`loadServersUI()`** in JS calls `window.pywebview.api.get_servers_info()` which returns JSON with `{servers: {gaistudio: {...}, chatgpt: {...}}, active_server: \"gaistudio\"|\"chatgpt\"}`.\n- **The `get_servers_info` backend method** internally calls `get_all_status(active_key)` which adds `is_active` to each server dict.\n\n### Failures / Constraints\n- **All 7 zombie PIDs on port 8000 return \"Access is denied\"** from standard `taskkill`. They were launched from an Administrator PowerShell session. Even `Stop-Process -Force` fails. The owner is `ABOISMAIL\\kakak` (same user) but elevated. The `ShellExecuteW(..., \"runas\", ...)` approach should work but requires UAC consent popup.\n- **PowerShell lowercase `powershell` is not recognized** in the current shell — must use `Start-Process` or native PowerShell cmdlets instead.\n- **`Get-CimInstance` WMI Filter** does not support `ProcessId in (...)` syntax — must use `or` chains like `ProcessId = 3524 or ProcessId = 764`.\n\n### Missing JS Function\n- `freeServerPorts()` is referenced in the HTML `onclick=\"freeServerPorts()\"` but **has NOT been defined yet** in the `<script>` section. This must be added before testing.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n| File | What Changed | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| `d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/desktop_app/server_manager.py` | `stop()` (lines ~153-195): batch PID elevation. `force_free_ports()` (lines ~373-416): single UAC for all ports | Fix one-UAC-per-PID spam