iating force port release (8000 & 8001)...');\n       showToast(currentLang === 'en' ? 'Freeing ports...' : 'جاري تحرير المنافذ...', 'info');\n       try {\n           const res = await window.pywebview.api.free_server_ports();\n           appendServerLog(`[SYSTEM] Port release result: ${JSON.stringify(res)}`);\n           showToast(currentLang === 'en' ? 'Ports freed!' : 'تم تحرير المنافذ بنجاح!', 'success');\n       } catch(e) {\n           appendServerLog(`[ERROR] Free ports failed: ${e.message}`);\n           showToast(currentLang === 'en' ? 'Error freeing ports' : 'خطأ في تحرير المنافذ', 'error');\n       }\n       await loadServersUI();\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify Python files compile:**\n   ```\n   python -m py_compile desktop_app/server_manager.py\n   python -m py_compile desktop_app/backend.py\n   ```\n\n3. **Clear WebView2 cache:** Delete `AppData\\Roaming\\pywebview\\EBWebView\\Default\\Cache` (or whatever cache dir exists) so the HTML/CSS/JS changes load fresh.\n\n4. **Run the app:** `python desktop_app/app.py` and verify:\n   - Screen-servers shows compact cards + full-height terminal without scrolling\n   - ChatGPT card shows ⚠️ محجوز خارجياً instead of إيقاف السيرفر\n   - Free Ports button works\n   - Settings page is clean (no duplicate server controls)\n\n5. **Inform user** about the zombie processes and how to use Free Ports button.\n\n### No customization/skill files were read during this conversation.\n\nYou have the 244 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de